  "description": "<h1 data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"180\">Nintendo Switch Game – Skyrim | ZGAN | €34,99</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"354\">Beleef epische avonturen in de uitgestrekte wereld van <strong data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"247\">Skyrim</strong> op je Nintendo Switch. Dit exemplaar verkeert in <strong data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"305\">ZGAN</strong> staat, is volledig getest en direct speelbaar.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"359\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"377\">Specificaties</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"580\">\r\n<li data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"395\">\r\n<p data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"395\">Titel: Skyrim</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"425\">\r\n<p data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"425\">Platform: Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"459\">\r\n<p data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"459\">Genre: RPG / Actie / Avontuur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"498\">\r\n<p data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"498\">Toestand: ZGAN – zo goed als nieuw</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"546\">\r\n<p data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"546\">Inclusief: Originele doos (indien aanwezig)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"580\">\r\n<p data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"580\">Plug & Play: Direct speelbaar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"585\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"599\">Voordelen</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"785\">\r\n<li data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"656\">\r\n<p data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"656\">Uitgestrekte open wereld en meeslepende RPG-ervaring</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"711\">\r\n<p data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"711\">Solo en multiplayer opties (indien van toepassing)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"734\">\r\n<p data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"734\">Direct plug & play</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"785\">\r\n<p data-start=\"737\" data-end=